# Project Structure

## Stack

- Turborepo + pnpm workspaces — monorepo
- Next.js 16 — App Router (`apps/web`, `apps/blog`, `apps/admin`)
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS (all apps) + shadcn/ui (`apps/admin`, `apps/blog`, `packages/ui`)
- Redux Toolkit — UI state + auth session (`apps/admin` only)
- TanStack Query v5 — server state (`apps/web`, `apps/admin`, `apps/blog`)
- Axios — HTTP client
- React Hook Form — forms (`apps/admin` only)

## Monorepo layout

```
